data
  title Trace retention funnel: 100% in, ~3-5% stored
  desc Head trims volume; tail curates what survives — 100% of errors and slow tails kept
  sequences
    - label 100% of traffic
      desc Every request starts a trace at the SDK root span
    - label 20% reaches the gateway
      desc ParentBased(TraceIdRatioBased(0.2)) head-samples — cuts the tail buffer 80%
    - label Tail keeps errors + slow tails
      desc 100% ERROR status, 100% latency over 1s, plus 1% baseline
    - label ~3-5% stored
      desc 100% of interesting traffic retained at a fraction of the bill
